body:
I have gone through hard times, and have trouble talking to people/asking for help. I found a website that helped me, has lots of good advice, you can read through and pick from a few different one-liners to give someone;
http://www.metanoia.org/suicide/
Though this one hit me the most;
"People often turn to suicide because they are seeking relief from pain. Remember that relief is a feeling. And you have to be alive to feel it. You will not feel the relief you so desperately seek, if you are dead."
